    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Harry Brann Auctioneers are delighted to present to the market, this exceptional 3 bedroomed semi-detached residence, located in a popular development within easy walking distance of all amenities in the lakeside towns of Ballina/Killaloe. Presented in pristine turn-key condition with the added bonus of a second-floor conversion, the property represents an ideal starter or down-sizer home for the would-be purchaser - Early viewing strongly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "To include - Entrance Hall, Lounge, Open-Plan Kitchen/Dining/Living Area, 3 Bedrooms - 1 En-suite, Family Bathroom, Guest WC, Utility &  2 Second Floor Storage Rooms (Ideal for Home Office use)."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 3.67m x 2.41m \r\nHigh gloss walnut timber floor. Carpeted stairs to first floor. Radiator cover.\r\n\r\nGuest WC - \r\nIncluded Above. Wall & floor tiled. WC & WHB. Extractor fan.\r\n\r\nLounge - 4.47m x 3.54m \r\nHigh gloss walnut timber floor. Solid fuel stove in marble surround fireplace with granite hearth. Bay window. TV & telephone points.\r\n\r\nOpen-Plan Kitchen/Dining/Living Area - \r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Area - 4.48m x 3.67m \r\nCeramic tiled floor. Fully fitted country cream units to include electric cooker with hob, oven & extractor. Plumbed for dishwasher. Over-counter tiling & under-counter lighting. Sliding PVC door to rear garden/patio area. Radiator cover. Arched access to living area. \r\n\r\nLiving Area - 3.88m x 2.80m \r\nHigh gloss walnut timber floor. Radiator cover.\r\n\r\nUtility - 2.92m x 1.48m \r\nCeramic tiled floor. Fully fitted country cream units to include sink. Plumbed for washing machine & dryer. Rear door access.\r\n\r\nLanding - 2.30m x 1.44m \r\n+2.58m. x 0.86m +2.86m x 0.93m. Carpeted. Stairs to second floor area. Fully shelved hot-press with immersion.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom 1 - 4.46m x 3.53m \r\n+ 2.14m x 0.71m. Bright & spacious. Carpeted. Wall-to-wall built-in wardrobes. Bay window.\r\n\r\nEn-Suite - 2.44m x 1.16m \r\nWall & floor tiled. Large electric shower, WC & WHB. Extractor fan.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom - 2.46m x 1.96m \r\n+ 0.92m. x 0.52m. Wall & floor tiled. Shower over bath, WC & WHB. Extractor fan.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.58m x 3.37m \r\nCarpeted. Built-in single wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.38m x 2.88m \r\n+1.10m x 1.02m Carpeted. 2-door built-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nSecond Floor Landing - 2.32m x 2.15m \r\n+ 2.18m x 0.85m Carpeted. Velux window allowing natural light through. Storage closet.\n\r\n\r\nSecond Floor Storage Room 1 - 4.47m x 2.33m \r\nCarpeted. Velux window allowing natural light through. Ideally suited to home office use.\r\n\r\nSecond Floor Storage Room 2 - 4.46m x 2.97m \r\nCarpeted. Velux window allowing natural light through. Ideally suited to home office use. Double door access to floored attic storage space.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Services to include - Zoned (3) mains gas central heating. Mains water & sewerage. \r\nPVC double glazed windows & rear entrance door. Hardwood front entrance door.\r\nNeatly manicured lawned gardens with mature trees & shrubbery beds edged with railway sleepers.\r\nWest-facing patio area to rear. Timber shed.\r\nTarmacadam driveway with off-street parking for 2 cars.\r\nOverlooks green area with mature trees."
      },
